(7351733, 1149881, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well done skyline.  I especially like the tiny people on the lower left by the river.</td>', 'Well done skyline.  I especially like the tiny people on the lower left by the river.', '2015-05-20 00:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351734, 1149801, 30982, '<td valign="top">Feels a bit like a drive-by shooting.  Love the plant-topped archaic phone booth - suits the title well - but the blur doesn''t really quite fit this for me.</td>', 'Feels a bit like a drive-by shooting.  Love the plant-topped archaic phone booth - suits the title well - but the blur doesn''t really quite fit this for me.', '2015-05-20 00:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351739, 1149837, 30982, '<td valign="top">I will have to say that I''m not sure the title suits the photograph.  The dog actually does look a little worried.  Or perhaps just a bit weary.  The framing is just a bit off to me - I like tight crops, but it just feels a little strange.  Maybe shoot down a bit lower looking either on the same plane as the eyes, or perhaps even a bit below?</td>', 'I will have to say that I''m not sure the title suits the photograph.  The dog actually does look a little worried.  Or perhaps just a bit weary.  The framing is just a bit off to me - I like tight crops, but it just feels a little strange.  Maybe shoot down a bit lower looking either on the same plane as the eyes, or perhaps even a bit below?', '2015-05-20 00:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351741, 1149999, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very sweet!</td>', 'Very sweet!', '2015-05-20 00:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7351745, 1150135, 30982, '<td valign="top">But he''s peeing on the wall.... not sure what that has to do with dying young unless there''s an open electrical circuit nearby... (Yes, yes, I know it has to do with the motorcycle and all, and he''s not young and still alive and therefore not good...)</td>', 'But he''s peeing on the wall.... not sure what that has to do with dying young unless there''s an open electrical circuit nearby... (Yes, yes, I know it has to do with the motorcycle and all, and he''s not young and still alive and therefore not good...)', '2015-05-20 00:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
