(7353084, 1150130, 61012, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the support and kind comments. <br/> <br/>I think I may be getting too critical of my own work. I came very close to not entering this because I thought there was something not quite right with it. <br/> <br/>Then I thought I was going to have to self DQ. Mid-week when I saw it was doing well I decided I better go secure the original. After a frantic search for the SD card I found it with the clean laundry in the dryer! The mini card was separated from the main card. I pieced them together, crossed my fingers and popped into the computer. Still worked!<br/> <br/>Reach a milestone with this shot. Now all of the top images in my profile are 7+, yahoo!<br/> <br/>Thanks again!</td>', 'Thank you all for the support and kind comments.  I think I may be getting too critical of my own work. I came very close to not entering this because I thought there was something not quite right with it.  Then I thought I was going to have to self DQ. Mid-week when I saw it was doing well I decided I better go secure the original. After a frantic search for the SD card I found it with the clean laundry in the dryer! The mini card was separated from the main card. I pieced them together, crossed my fingers and popped into the computer. Still worked! Reach a milestone with this shot. Now all of the top images in my profile are 7+, yahoo! Thanks again!', '2015-05-25 09:50:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7353090, 1150130, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by DJWoodward:</b></div><hr/><i> Thank you all for the support and kind comments. <br/> <br/>I think I may be getting too critical of my own work. I came very close to not entering this because I thought there was something not quite right with it. <br/> <br/>Then I thought I was going to have to self DQ. Mid-week when I saw it was doing well I decided I better go secure the original. After a frantic search for the SD card I found it with the clean laundry in the dryer! The mini card was separated from the main card. I pieced them together, crossed my fingers and popped into the computer. Still worked!<br/> <br/>Reach a milestone with this shot. Now all of the top images in my profile are 7+, yahoo!<br/> <br/>Thanks again! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>What a story!!!  Strange how critical you were..... but I can totally agree also, I do that all the time.</td>', 'Originally posted by DJWoodward: Thank you all for the support and kind comments.  I think I may be getting too critical of my own work. I came very close to not entering this because I thought there was something not quite right with it.  Then I thought I was going to have to self DQ. Mid-week when I saw it was doing well I decided I better go secure the original. After a frantic search for the SD card I found it with the clean laundry in the dryer! The mini card was separated from the main card. I pieced them together, crossed my fingers and popped into the computer. Still worked! Reach a milestone with this shot. Now all of the top images in my profile are 7+, yahoo! Thanks again!   What a story!!!  Strange how critical you were..... but I can totally agree also, I do that all the time.', '2015-05-25 10:17:52.000000', NULL, 0),
