(7353173, 1150130, 109227, '<td valign="top">Great shot, especially the 3D affect it has.  It almost looks like the pieces were cut out and placed for the scene.  Congrats.</td>', 'Great shot, especially the 3D affect it has.  It almost looks like the pieces were cut out and placed for the scene.  Congrats.', '2015-05-25 13:47:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7353184, 1150141, 108069, '<td valign="top">Heck of a photo. The movement and those teeth adds up to a sinister look and being too close for comfort. The motion and contrast of the grass has me wondering if I''m not already being chomped. The top right looks like a delicate, safe place to hide -- if I could only get up there. But I''m stuck here in a glass house on the west side and the mad dogs are running wild. Great entry! Lucky to have eluded you... this time.</td>', 'Heck of a photo. The movement and those teeth adds up to a sinister look and being too close for comfort. The motion and contrast of the grass has me wondering if I''m not already being chomped. The top right looks like a delicate, safe place to hide -- if I could only get up there. But I''m stuck here in a glass house on the west side and the mad dogs are running wild. Great entry! Lucky to have eluded you... this time.', '2015-05-25 14:13:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7353190, 1150108, 123833, '<td valign="top">Nice result from so many tools!! And good for Iphone 6.</td>', 'Nice result from so many tools!! And good for Iphone 6.', '2015-05-25 15:00:51.000000', NULL, 0),
